WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.670
Here’s a writer’s trick.

00:00:01.670 --> 00:00:08.580
When a sentence needs two little helper words to show how someone moved, the verb underneath is usually too weak.

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:11.790
Swap in one strong verb, and the helpers can go.

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:13.610
Say both versions out loud.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:16.350
Which one sounds like someone sneaking past a guard?
